WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,590
Lao Xue, you don’t know that Lao Pei was so beaten that he even turned into a pig’s head?

2
00:00:04,590 --> 00:00:06,110
Even his parents can't recognize him.

3
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:07,190
He also has today

4
00:00:07,190 --> 00:00:08,190
As soon as I receive your letter

5
00:00:08,190 --> 00:00:09,990
Three horses died overnight and Baoju came over

6
00:00:09,990 --> 00:00:11,990
Just to see his pig head with my own eyes

7
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:14,190
The most annoying thing is

8
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:15,190
For the sake of face

9
00:00:15,190 --> 00:00:17,390
He insisted that the one who beat him was a weak scholar

10
00:00:17,390 --> 00:00:19,190
Tattoos can break his hand bones

11
00:00:19,190 --> 00:00:20,590
It really made me laugh to death

12
00:00:22,910 --> 00:00:24,810
Dad, why don’t you laugh?

13
00:00:24,810 --> 00:00:26,410
Who are you looking at with this constipated expression?

14
00:00:26,410 --> 00:00:27,510
Lao Pei

15
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:30,510
Didn't you go catch dad and give him medicine? Why did we just come to you so quickly?

16
00:00:30,510 --> 00:00:32,010
Very funny, right?

17
00:00:32,010 --> 00:00:33,510
You two Laowangs?

18
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:35,010
I'm telling the truth

19
00:00:35,010 --> 00:00:36,910
That's really a big guy wearing a mountain of clothes

20
00:00:36,910 --> 00:00:41,970
Why don’t you believe me, Lao Pei?

21
00:00:41,970 --> 00:00:43,670
You are really like a pig. Ouch, I can't do it anymore.

22
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:44,670
Laughing makes my stomach hurt

23
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:47,170
I don’t care about you anymore, husband

24
00:00:47,170 --> 00:00:49,070
Are we too damaged? Lao Pei is still seriously injured.

25
00:00:49,070 --> 00:00:50,570
I was so angry that I ran away for three whole days and there was no news.

26
00:00:50,570 --> 00:00:52,270
What if you meet an enemy?

27
00:00:52,270 --> 00:00:54,170
After all, Lao Pei has been a life and death brother for decades.

28
00:00:54,170 --> 00:00:57,870
Let's go down the mountain to find him as the shopkeeper.

29
00:00:57,870 --> 00:00:59,470
Serve two pots of good herbal tea to catch the rats

30
00:00:59,470 --> 00:01:04,620
Okay, guest, please wait a moment.

31
00:01:04,620 --> 00:01:06,280
It must be this monster

32
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:08,380
Lao Pei actually didn’t lie

33
00:01:08,380 --> 00:01:10,480
Is there really such a humanoid tyrannosaurus that is as thick as a mountain?
